/src/bin/scripts/

logmaint

Utility will manually alternate syslog files. After rotation of syslog files
it uses grep to rip through the syslogs and export events to specified logs.
Events in the specialized logs save between 300 - 1000 entries.
Usage Example:
If the utility resides in the root RavenMUD directory use the following
command - ./logmaint

/src/bin/binaries/

qpcheck

Utility queries pfiles for saved quest points. Outputs QP associated with each
user and an average QP count dependent on level. Utility must be run from the
sys folder.
Usage Example
./qpcheck
